OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,7,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,8,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,9,Fdisruption in the afternoon. It is
OL,10,Funderstood that very few flights are
OL,11,Fcurrently taking off.
